WEBVTT

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:19.040
<b>tsukinuketa aoi sora</b>

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:19.040
<b>The blue sky has broken through</b>

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.040
<b>saa dekakeyou</b>

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.040
<b>Come, let's go out</b>

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:28.880
<b>itsumo no namikimichi jitensha wo koideku</b>

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:28.880
<b>Riding my bike through the usual avenue</b>

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:33.550
<b>ima sugu ni aitai yo</b>

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:33.550
<b>"I want to meet you now."</b>

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:36.800
<b>omoi ga kaze wo kiri</b>

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:36.800
<b>That thought is blown away by the wind,</b>

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>kimi e to hakondeku tegami ni natte</b>

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>and becomes a letter being carried to you</b>

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:52.360
<b>koko kara hajimaru monogatari fly!</b>

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:52.360
<b>The story that starts from here... Fly!</b>

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:59.660
<b>kawariyuku kisetsu ga ashioto wo tatetemo</b>

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:59.660
<b>Even if the changing seasons walk on with loud footsteps,</b>

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:06.500
<b>sou kawaranai suki to iu tsubasa</b>

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:06.500
<b>the wings of love won't change</b>

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:14.510
<b>dokomade mo tondeke oozora takaku</b>

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:14.510
<b>Fly far away, high into the sky</b>

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:20.720
<b>koi no tenki yohou hare nochi hare ni nare</b>

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:20.720
<b>May the weather forecast of love be sunny and clear forever</b>

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:28.400
<b>ashita mo asatte mo</b>

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:28.400
<b>Tomorrow and the day after tomorrow</b>

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:33.990
Tama's room

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:33.990
Tama's room

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:39.320
She still hasn't come back.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:45.000
<b>Episode 3     I didn't mean it</b>

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:41.160
Of course not.

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:42.870
She's not there.

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:44.660
Your words don't show any love for her.

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:46.620
It's already been 3 days.

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:49.670
Well, Tama has to socialize with other cats.

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:51.960
Socialize?

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:55.470
Yes, like going out for drinks or taking a trip to a hot spring.

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:56.670
Is that true?

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:57.930
Of course it's true.

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:00.050
I saw it many times as a kid.

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:02.220
Cats would grumble while they sipped milk,

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:04.140
from an earthenware pipe on some empty piece of land.

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:08.100
Tama's room

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:08.100
Tama's room

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:06.930
Where is she wandering around?

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:06.930
Tama must have a lot to do.

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:13.320
Don't you have any idea?

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:15.400
Did you do anything to make her want to run away?

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:16.940
How could I do such a thing?

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:20.530
I washed her in the bathtub 
everyday because she had fleas.

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.780
I gave her a tangerine for dessert.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:27.000
I played with her all day on 
Sunday until she was exhausted.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.500
I've been petting her quite frequently.

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:33.380
Cats feel burdened by those things.

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:36.130
Why?

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.760
Good morning, Yurie-chan.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:43.140
Good morning.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:44.600
Good morning.

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:50.060
Sunrise Ferry

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:50.060
Purveyor to the god

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:56.860
All right. All right.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.030
Stand in a line!

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.740
Don't cut in it!

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:02.990
So it's like this.

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.740
I broke a glass in the faculty room.

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:09.910
Can you do something so that I don't have to pay for it?

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.670
I lost my wallet!

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:15.130
Do you think someone else has it?

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:15.130
What? Well, I—

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:19.380
My grades went down and my 
monthly allowance was reduced.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:20.720
Can you do something?

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.590
Well, I don't think I can help—

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:25.970
Okay! Okay!

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:28.060
You can only take one picture.

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:29.890
Okay! Okay!

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:33.480
Spiritual photo?

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:36.480
Her reputation isn't too bad.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:39.740
She's the number one god in 
our whole school's god history!

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:42.200
Let's keep it up!

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:45.870
I can't keep it up if it continues like this everyday.

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:50.040
Are all the gods so busy like this?

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:54.500
Today's consultations were all about money, weren't they?

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.380
Everybody has money problems.

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.670
It's because the economy isn't doing well.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:01.590
They all wrote money requests 
on our shrine's wish plaques.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.260
Don't you think it's strange?

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:06.390
My personal allowance is only 800 yen per month.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:10.020
I can't answer their questions about money.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:12.850
Let's ask him.

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:19.530
Come out, 
Yashima-sama

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:19.530
Is this all right?

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:20.820
Okay!

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.450
Come out!

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:27.030
Come out!

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:29.580
Come out! Come out!

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:42.420
Did you call me?

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.600
It seems recently many people need help with money.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:48.850
Do you know why?

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:51.310
Oh, that's right.

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:54.890
There's not even one yen in our collection box this week.

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:56.010
What did you say?

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:57.650
What's going on?!

00:04:57.650 --> 00:04:59.360
Could you calm down?

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:03.780
The poverty warning has been issued.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.280
What is it?

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:09.660
The poverty god is approaching.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.870
That's why it is affecting this area.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:15.460
He's detested in every place 
he goes, so he just floats around.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:17.750
So, we get the forecast every month.

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:19.880
What will happen if he comes here?

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:22.000
Everybody will become poor.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.340
That's not good!

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:26.220
I finally planned a way to get out of debt!

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:27.720
Yes.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:30.050
So, let's prepare to prevent it.

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.220
Prepare to prevent it?

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:37.140
Sign: Great luck

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:45.740
Does this really work?

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:47.450
Yes it does.

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:51.450
If we distribute these all over town, it 
will purify the town and increase its luck.

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:54.370
So, we can counter attack the 
misfortune spread out by the poverty god.

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:56.460
But if we have this little—

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.750
it doesn't seem likely it will help much.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:08.090
Why do I have to do this?

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:10.760
Your shrine's god is telling us to do it.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:12.180
Of course you have to.

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:18.190
You did it.

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:21.060
Hey, it's the guitar girl!

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:23.190
Hey! Play for me! Play for me!

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:25.360
Are you going to play some rock today?

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:26.540
Yeah!

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:27.570
Yeah!

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:30.070
I want some peace of mind—

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:35.240
To tell you the truth, we can't 
listen to everyone's requests.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:40.370
If we make everyone's requests come 
true, nobody would do anything.

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:44.710
Then, how can I select the requests 
that I should make come true?

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:46.880
Let's see—

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:50.550
Why don't you join the God Association?

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:53.300
The God Association?

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.470
It's a gathering of gods.

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:58.930
If you join, they'll send you 
a collection and delivery team.

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:00.940
A collection and delivery team?

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:05.690
They sort out the requests given
 to you and deliver them to you.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.990
For the time being, you just have 
to make those requests come true.

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:10.530
So you can begin to understand the work of a god.

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:13.910
Then, can you help me join it?

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:17.330
It'll take a while to go through the process.

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:19.750
Please be patient until then.

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.120
I'll be patient.

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:22.460
Yes.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:25.540
I'm home.

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:28.130
Welcome back!

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:31.130
We got a lifetime's worth of them.

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:32.930
Thank you very much.

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.430
Then, let's wrap up for the preparation.

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:37.720
We'll distribute those all over town tomorrow.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:38.770
Yes.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:41.480
What's that?

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:49.610
Sign: Have you seen my cat Tama?

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:45.150
Can I distribute this with them?

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:46.820
I don't mind.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:48.820
But what kind of creature is Tama?

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:00.000
You worry too much, Yurie.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.210
I just heard about this today.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:06.210
Kuwahara's cat used to run away 
for about a week or so at a time.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:10.130
Then one day, it comes back 
unexpectedly as if nothing happened.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:13.380
Cats are like that.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:33.110
Hey! Can I keep her?

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:33.780
Can I?

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:34.860
Well—

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:37.740
If you can take care of it on your own, you can keep it.

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:39.540
I will! I will!

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:44.210
If you don't take good care of her, 
I'll throw her away to "Thrilled Cat Land".

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:45.880
What is that?

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:48.540
Akane-san, you don't know it?

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.380
It's a stray cat kingdom across the ocean.

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:52.550
Oh, my!

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:54.630
Cats without caretakers

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:56.970
are working hard there trying to be self-sufficient!

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:56.010
What's her name?

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.720
I want to go there!

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:02.770
Really? Do you want to go there?

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:03.560
Yes!

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:06.600
Oh, she's so cute!

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.060
It's too much!

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:10.900
From now on your name is Tama!

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:14.070
Yurie! Look over here!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:32.980
Now we'll start the poverty god prevention ceremony.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:34.400
We are not going to be poor.

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:36.840
We won't let the people become 
poor. We don't bring in poverty.

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:40.010
We should have this attitude, 
and act with the deepest of grace.

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:41.470
Yes.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:34.320
It's been a long time since I felt this divine power!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.400
Thank you. I'm so refreshed!

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:37.860
You're welcome.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:39.320
Leave it to me!

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:41.910
I'll watch out for anyone suspicious!

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.370
And one more thing—

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:45.740
Sign: Have you seen my cat Tama?

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:48.460
Okay! I'll let you know if I see her.

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.250
Thank you very much.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:56.690
It can't be—

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:00.690
We worked really hard.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:06.330
<b>Due to circumstances out of service.</b>

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:06.330
<b>Sunrise Ferry</b>

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:10.700
What's going on?

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:12.870
Mitsue-chan—

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.170
Is this because of the poverty god?

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:19.510
Do you think so?

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:20.260
I don't know!

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:23.720
<b>Closed due to circumstances
Yamada Fashion Store</b>

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:24.720
<b>Thank you for your 
patronage all this time.
Suzuki Futon Store</b>

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:25.930
For sale

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:25.930
For sale

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:30.770
Wait!

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:31.390
Sign: Sunset Bank

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:32.350
This isn't good!

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:32.350
Money!

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:37.270
What's going on?

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:39.980
Poverty god—

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.900
No! He's already here!

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:44.990
In this town?!

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:47.910
Yes, but it's strange.

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:50.450
According to the previous issue, 
he shouldn't be here so soon.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.750
I read the one two issues earlier.

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:56.290
Ouch!

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:57.960
Yashima-sama!?

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:01.550
Hey, why did you hit my head!?

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:03.760
Because you were so stupid and senile!

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:07.140
Your god was stupid and senile!

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:08.220
It's not me—

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:10.320
I'm sorry.

00:13:10.320 --> 00:13:13.560
While I ran away, things got messed up.

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:16.100
So, the poverty god has already arrived.

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:19.610
Yes, at this point, we must confront him.

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:22.940
We should meet him face to face 
and chase him away to another town.

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:25.990
But, where is he?

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:34.540
We are measuring the happiness 
points of the town right now.

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:37.880
The area where the poverty god is hiding—

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:37.370
Sign: Great luck

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:37.880
Sign: Worst luck

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:40.380
will be misfortunate compared to other areas.

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.170
Sign: Great luck

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:43.590
So, he must be at the unluckiest point.

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:41.630
Sign: Worst luck

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:44.670
Yes.

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:01.110
These areas all have the worst luck!

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:02.440
This is strange.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.440
It shouldn't be.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:06.530
If you can solve the problem by just saying "it shouldn't be",

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:08.360
Sis, Stop it!

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:07.820
we don't need the police or the shrine!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.240
Everybody! Look at this!

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:14.950
Signs: Absolutely rotten luck

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:33.770
This is the place!

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:35.140
How could it be?

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:37.770
It's often difficult to see what's right in front you.

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:39.520
It's like a moth flying into the flame.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:41.730
I'll get him with just one shot!

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.520
Sis, you're scaring me.

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:49.700
Tama!

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.200
Tama?

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.830
She looks different from the picture.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:54.660
Why are you here?

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:56.080
Don't get any closer!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.290
That's not an ordinary cat!

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.920
But, it's Tama.

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:02.880
There we go.

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:05.500
It's not Tama.

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:07.400
I'm sorry.

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:09.220
I'm the poverty—

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.550
Don't move!

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:12.050
No!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.220
Hey! Wait!

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:16.390
Matsuri-chan!

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:20.560
The poverty god unfairly took over Tama's body.

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:22.650
How can you even say that!

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:22.650
Miko-san.

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:24.280
Put up the divine tags in all directions

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:26.280
around the shrine so the god can't leave.

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:25.770
Wait!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:26.940
Yes.

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:28.610
Matsuri-chan, don't!

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:31.070
That isn't Tama!

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:33.870
It's a devil that brings disaster to my shrine!

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:35.530
So, don't even protect him!

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:39.580
I'm not protecting him.

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:49.800
Got you!

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:56.930
Those were expensive!

00:15:58.180 --> 00:15:59.270
Are you all right?

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:18.370
I won't let you go.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:27.250
I wasn't going to run away, but she was so scary, so—

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.960
I see lots of stars!

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:28.960
Sis! Wake up!

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:30.980
What about Tama?

00:16:30.980 --> 00:16:32.590
What happened to her!?

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:34.180
Is she inside of you?

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:35.930
Yes.

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:41.350
Give Tama back to me!

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:43.560
Get out of her body!

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:47.650
The whole town is so troubled because of you!

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:54.780
I understand.

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:58.370
I know I've troubled everybody.

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.010
I'm so sorry.

00:17:02.010 --> 00:17:03.210
Goodbye.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:04.870
<i>Don't go yet!</i>

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.000
Tama! Is that really you?

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:13.550
<i>Yurie-chan! Please don't let him out!</i>

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:15.970
Why? He's a poverty god!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:18.680
<i>But he saved my life!</i>

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:30.980
<i>Five days ago, I was trying to run away from home.</i>

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:33.490
<i>Don't misunderstand.</i>

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:36.660
<i>It's true I was stressed out 
by how you were treating me,</i>

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:38.160
<i>but that wasn't the reason.</i>

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:42.330
<i>I wanted to explore new possibilities.</i>

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:44.870
<i>I wanted to depart from the world I knew.</i>

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:49.920
<i>Just like the saying, I jumped 
into the raging waves of the world!</i>

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:54.920
<i>And then I drowned.</i>

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:57.470
<i>I didn't know much about the real world.</i>

00:17:57.470 --> 00:18:00.050
<i>I even forgot that I couldn't swim.</i>

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:01.510
Tama—

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:06.310
<i>I thought that I was going to die.</i>

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:11.230
<i>My rough days with you ran through 
my mind like a revolving lantern.</i>

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:23.620
<i>At that moment, he entered 
my body and saved my life.</i>

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:28.710
<i>I also became very poor after that.</i>

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:30.920
<i>I haven't eaten anything since then.</i>

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:41.640
Well, the poverty god is inside you.

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:46.770
So, you hid under the eaves 
until you regained your strength.

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:49.600
You didn't realize that?

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:53.400
I think his energy was a little bit weak.

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:56.360
<i>Yurie-chan, please!</i>

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:59.240
<i>The poverty god needs a place to stay.</i>

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:01.570
<i>Can you keep him at your place?</i>

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:04.120
But, he's a poverty god.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.790
<i>He also saved my life.</i>

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:10.790
<i>I'd already be dead if he wasn't there.</i>

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:20.130
Since this is a domestic affair 
I shouldn't give any advice.

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:26.260
Tama-chan, I appreciate your 
kindness, but it's impossible.

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:30.480
I, the poverty god, only spread 
misfortune to those around me.

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:32.440
<i>It's not true!</i>

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:34.690
<i>You saved my life, didn't you?</i>

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:39.860
<i>You shouldn't judge yourself by what other people say.</i>

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:43.700
<i>The poverty god also has a right to happiness!</i>

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.330
Thank you very much, Tama-chan.

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:51.160
Your kindness has inspired me 
to return to my usual poor life.

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:52.210
<i>No way!</i>

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:53.880
<i>If you can't keep him at home, I'll go with him.</i>

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:58.170
<i>Yurie-chan, thank you very much for everything.</i>

00:19:59.010 --> 00:19:59.760
<i>Farewell!</i>

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:00.550
Don't go!

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:03.050
I understand. He can stay!

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:03.050
<i>Let go of me! Yurie-chan!</i>

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:04.930
I don't like being poor—

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:04.870
<i>It hurts a lot!</i>

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:07.560
but I would dislike it much 
more if you weren't with me!

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:15.400
<i>Then, can we keep him?</i>

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:19.860
You should take good care of him on your own.

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:22.740
<i>Yes!</i>

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:52.980
Sign: Worst luck

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:54.440
Sign: Amazing luck

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:09.780
Sign: Have you seen my cat Tama?

00:21:09.780 --> 00:21:12.250
Sign: My cat Tama has been found!

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:27.590
No way, it's fixed!

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:38.690
What's this all about?

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:42.030
It's because of your power.

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:55.330
Sign: Happy

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:18.730
For now, at least in this town,

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:22.070
the poverty god's power seems to have been cast off.

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:27.740
You just have to fill in that power once in a while.

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:29.260
I'll do that!

00:22:29.260 --> 00:22:31.170
He's our family pet now.

00:22:31.170 --> 00:22:32.990
Sorry to have caused you trouble.

00:22:33.490 --> 00:22:34.490
Don't worry.

00:22:34.490 --> 00:22:38.210
As long as you're here, Tama won't run away.

00:22:39.370 --> 00:22:41.920
<i>I'll think about it after I learn how to swim.</i>

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:44.500
Yurie!

00:22:45.170 --> 00:22:47.470
Can you help us tie up the fortune strips?

00:22:47.470 --> 00:22:48.260
Yes.

00:22:53.390 --> 00:22:56.020
It's so kind of her to keep me.

00:22:57.930 --> 00:23:02.940
Whether it's a god or person, Yurie-sama 
just can't abandon those in trouble.

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:05.860
She is an extraordinary god.

00:23:06.990 --> 00:23:08.400
She's a great person.

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:12.490
Poverty god 
forecast series 
thankfully 
suspended!

00:23:16.230 --> 00:23:22.300
<b>mada mada zenzen owannai last ichijikan no jugyou desu</b>

00:23:16.230 --> 00:23:22.300
<b>The last class of the day never seems to end</b>

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:27.170
<b>tokei wo chira chira mitemo ichi byou ga nagai ne</b>

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:27.170
<b>Even if I keep glancing at my watch, a second seems an eternity</b>

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:34.250
<b>mabushii koutei mieru kimi no hashiru sugata oikake</b>

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:34.250
<b>In the radiant schoolyard, trailing your running visage,</b>

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:39.390
<b>houkago love-love date mousou shite bosou chuu</b>

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:39.390
<b>my imagination is running wild about our date after class</b>

00:23:40.290 --> 00:23:43.310
<b>chime no kane koi no signal</b>

00:23:40.290 --> 00:23:43.310
<b>The school chimes ring and it's a signal of love!</b>

00:23:43.310 --> 00:23:46.290
<b>rouka no tobidashi ni wa chuui</b>

00:23:43.310 --> 00:23:46.290
<b>Be careful if you rush out into the hallway!</b>

00:23:46.290 --> 00:23:49.280
<b>kimi no moto e ichiban saki ni</b>

00:23:46.290 --> 00:23:49.280
<b>I dash to see you, first thing!</b>

00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:51.880
<b>issho ni kaerou</b>

00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:51.880
<b>Let's go home together!</b>

00:23:52.870 --> 00:23:59.520
<b>soda aji no ice candy gira gira na ohisama no shita hanbunko</b>

00:23:52.870 --> 00:23:59.520
<b>Sharing a soda-flavored popsicle under the glaring sun</b>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:05.560
<b>torokesou na atashi no seishun desu doki doki shichau</b>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:05.560
<b>My youth seems to melt with it, it makes my heart beat faster</b>

00:24:05.560 --> 00:24:11.260
<b>kono nanigenai toki wo ima mune ni shimatte</b>

00:24:05.560 --> 00:24:11.260
<b>I'm shutting our casual time in my heart</b>

00:24:11.330 --> 00:24:18.460
<b>asu wa mata kyou yori mo kimi wo suki ni naru no desu</b>

00:24:11.330 --> 00:24:18.460
<b>Tomorrow I will love you even more than today</b>

00:24:22.570 --> 00:24:37.580
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:23.810 --> 00:24:26.150
A message from space was suddenly sent to us.

00:24:26.150 --> 00:24:30.750
Are those who traveled from far in 
the distance our friends or invaders?

00:24:30.750 --> 00:24:32.280
Chu! Chu! Chu! And Chu!

00:24:32.470 --> 00:24:37.580
<b>Earth's Crisis</b>

00:24:32.570 --> 00:24:35.450
Kamichu, next episode is "Earth's Crisis".

00:24:35.450 --> 00:24:36.410
I'll save it!
